1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:07,042
Property Desk turns a maintenance report into a tracked case. A
tenant reports a leaking kitchen tap.

2
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:16,818
Staff see the request and its blockers. Two checks still need
review: the person and property, and a verified contact route.

3
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:22,433
Resolving the first check leaves the second open.

4
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:35,213
Once both are resolved, the local Vercel Workflow rechecks the
case and records a simulated quote request. The action history
shows what happened.

5
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:43,426
Staff can propose a policy change. This suggestion remains
unsaved and unpublished.

6
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:52,762
The repair is not yet confirmed. This is a local demo. External
actions are simulated.
